<p>This endpoint is <strong>public and metered</strong>. Anonymous callers share a budget per client address; callers with a bearer token are <strong>not limited at all</strong>.</p>
<table>
<tr><th>Budget (per address)</th><th>Value</th></tr>
<tr><td>Sustained rate</td><td>{{RATE_PER_SECOND}} requests per second, bursts up to {{RATE_BURST}}</td></tr>
<tr><td>Per hour</td><td>about {{QUOTA_HOUR}} requests</td></tr>
<tr><td>Per day</td><td>about {{QUOTA_DAY}} requests</td></tr>
<tr><td>Concurrent connections</td><td>{{CONN_LIMIT}}</td></tr>
</table>
<p>Budgets are enforced as token buckets, so steady traffic under the quota is never touched and bursts above it are slowed with a <code>429</code> rather than cut off.</p>
<h3>Using a token</h3>
<p>Send it as a bearer credential. Tokens never go in the URL.</p>
<pre><code>curl -H "Authorization: Bearer gb..." https://{{DOMAIN}}{{PREFIX}}{{EXAMPLE_PATH}}</code></pre>
<p>Tokens are issued to applications and partners by the getBible team; ask through <a href="https://getBible.net">getBible.net</a>.</p>
